    "description": "Polished Mineral & Gemstone Lot - 7 Pieces\nNatural Crystal & Lapidary Specimens\nMineral Collectibles\nThis collection features an assortment of seven natural lapidary pieces, including smooth polished palm stones and a raw crystal formation. Highlighting various geological textures, colors, and optical phenomena such as labradorescence, these specimens serve as tactile pocket stones, meditation aids, or decorative display pieces.\nItems Included:\nLabradorite polished oval palm stone showcasing vivid blue flash\nPolychrome jasper polished stone with green, tan, and terracotta banding\nBrown and black swirled banded jasper palm stone with glossy polish\nJet black polished oval stone with reflective surface\nOcean/moss jasper stone featuring mottled earth tones and natural druzy pits\nDeep red and brown jasper polished cabochon-style stone\nNatural clear quartz crystal cluster specimen with rough terminations\nCondition:\nStones are in very good condition with smooth, high-gloss finishes on all polished pieces. Natural geological surface variations, including small druzy cavities, mineral pits, and internal fracture lines, are present as naturally occurring characteristics. The raw quartz shows natural crystalline rough edges with no notable artificial breaks.\nThank you for all of your support!",
